  "description": "Plug and play AI safety middleware for .NET. Ships with ML models out of the box: prompt injection (DeBERTa v3), PII NER (XLM-RoBERTa), multilingual toxicity (DistilBERT, 104 languages), and semantic harm-category classification (multilingual e5-base embeddings, 50+ languages, 19 categories). Works as ASP.NET Core middleware or standalone.",
